        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 953a2632-a2e7-4842-a484-c8953c5bc43b).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\r\rOur client, a billionare Southerner from the state of Mississippi, and self-proclaimed white supremacist, wants you to headshot the five &quot;brown&quot; patients currently staying at the Gamma medical facility in Hokkaido. He wants to send a message that &quot;their kind ain&apos;t welcome &apos;round here&quot; His words 47. \r\rAlso he wants you to avoid hurting or killing anyone else at all costs. \r\rI&apos;ll be blunt, this contract is a hate crime, so I won&apos;t bat an eye if you decide to turn this one down.",
